ame":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"TlokHyfEx0HxFYKDkvpdBg","review_id":"DxAc-Gwh9QnKb9LaB7KhMA","date":"2013-06-02T21:16:53","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9424012303352356,"text_excerpt":"So glad this opened up in my neighborhood! This place is right up my alley: it's healthy, fresh, and they have awesome juices and coffee. I have dined in many times and also ordered out. They are quick and friendly. The green breakfast sandwich is simple and filling (especially when you get it on an everything bagel-mmmm!) They have a wide variety of juices (the sweet tart is my favorite) and pastries if you want to go for the lighter meal and they have new specials daily and each one I have had has been delicious. People complaining about the prices obviously don't know how much real food costs. The juices have 4 or 5 different fruits and veggies in them and can be a meal all in itself. ..."},{"business_id":"TlokHyfEx0HxFYKDkvpdBg","review_id":"dBM4Z4FNnor4c18sElFJAw","date":"2018-11-28T20:35:54","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9369019865989685,"text_excerpt":"I love this place. Good food, good coffee, and friendly service. What else do you need? I've had almost every one of their breakfast dishes and a few of the salads and sandwiches. I LOVE LOVE LOVE that they have gluten free bread options. And that the coffee is bottomless since sometimes I do like to sit and do some work- which they totally accept. The outdoor seating area is super cute and dog friendly, although for larger parties I'm not sure. One of my fav weekday breakfast places!"},{"business_id":"TlokHyfEx0HxFYKDkvpdBg","review_id":"KQqOlFLOxgbKZvtIekh--g","date":"2019-10-20T18:40:39","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9323192834854126,"text_excerpt":"Love this place! Amazing breakfast, brunch and lunch options! I love that they have gluten free/friendly options. The juices are amazing, and reasonably priced. Just tired the lemonade lavender today and it was AWESOME! Never a bad experience when I go to Satsuma!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"TlokHyfEx0HxFYKDkvpdBg","photo_id":"7haQ8xAzFauMpvJEEvH26g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/7haQ8xAzFauMpvJEEvH26g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9088029861450195},{"business_id":"TlokHyfEx0HxFYKDkvpdBg","photo_id":"7__gNgqyraJNNT6emNyIeg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/7__gNgqyraJNNT6emNyIeg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8834917545318604},{"business_id":"TlokHyfEx0HxFYKDkvpdBg","photo_id":"-pvYLt5VYJynaQljSFG-9Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/-pvYLt5VYJynaQljSFG-9Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8673139810562134},{"business_id":"TlokHyfEx0HxFYKDkvpdBg","photo_id":"dpQ5li1ehQQkdUqEK0ixMQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/dpQ5li1ehQQkdUqEK0ixMQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8250070810317993},{"business_id":"TlokHyfEx0HxFYKDkvpdBg","photo_id":"UkND10zG7h9f4UFio6WklA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/UkND10zG7h9f4UFio6WklA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.816887378692627}]},"notebook_case":null}
